1
00:00:09,760 --> 00:00:11,900
Give me back my disciple.

2
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:34,580
Mount Zhaowu...

3
00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:37,090
Could it be...

4
00:00:39,110 --> 00:00:41,120
High Immortal Danshen has survived your ordeal.

5
00:00:41,350 --> 00:00:42,610
What wonderful news!

6
00:00:42,840 --> 00:00:44,500
I never imagined that while I slept,

7
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:46,410
so much would happen.

8
00:00:47,030 --> 00:00:48,540
Thank you, esteemed sect leaders, for handling it all.

9
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:50,900
Enough with the pleasantries.

10
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:52,540
Qi Fengyin

11
00:00:52,790 --> 00:00:55,090
has broken free of the Wanjun Lock.

12
00:00:55,520 --> 00:00:56,820
And since High Immortal Danshen has awakened safely...

13
00:00:56,840 --> 00:00:57,410
It seems

14
00:00:58,030 --> 00:00:59,180
Qi Fengyin has gone into hiding.

15
00:01:21,580 --> 00:01:27,460
♪Winds rise. Youth fades. Joy and sorrow turn to nothing♪

16
00:01:29,500 --> 00:01:35,460
♪Blossoms fade away. This fleeting life is but a dream♪

17
00:01:36,500 --> 00:01:40,740
♪Desire blinds my eyes♪

18
00:01:44,420 --> 00:01:51,980
♪Our paths now part, and I cannot make you stay♪

19
00:01:52,340 --> 00:01:59,100
♪If love is deadly poison, hate is a furnace that sears the heart♪

20
00:02:00,340 --> 00:02:06,980
♪What is devotion? I fool my heart and spin my own cocoon♪

21
00:02:08,180 --> 00:02:15,020
♪Anger, obsession, greed, resentment, and envy bring trials across lifetimes♪

22
00:02:16,620 --> 00:02:23,140
♪The past turns to dust. I regret nothing, though my love was misplaced♪

23
00:02:27,900 --> 00:02:29,700
[Blossom in Darkness]

24
00:02:29,700 --> 00:02:31,700
[Based on the novel "Blossom in Darkness" by Guo Guo]

25
00:02:31,700 --> 00:02:34,700
[Episode 20]

26
00:02:36,240 --> 00:02:37,690
But without the Wanjun Lock,

27
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:39,060
that devil will be even harder

28
00:02:39,060 --> 00:02:39,690
to deal with.

29
00:02:40,030 --> 00:02:40,690
Who knows when

30
00:02:40,710 --> 00:02:41,640
he'll come back for revenge?

31
00:02:41,870 --> 00:02:43,570
Now that the Saintess of the Tides has appeared,

32
00:02:44,310 --> 00:02:44,980
why are you all

33
00:02:45,400 --> 00:02:47,260
still looking so worried?

34
00:02:47,520 --> 00:02:48,340
The Saintess of the Tides

35
00:02:48,630 --> 00:02:49,890
previously asked the Five Great Sects

36
00:02:50,030 --> 00:02:52,060
to help refine an Immortal Sect Token.

37
00:02:53,470 --> 00:02:55,410
But the token's power is immense,

38
00:02:55,590 --> 00:02:57,340
so naturally, we had our doubts.

39
00:02:57,430 --> 00:02:58,820
And as soon as Danshen returned,

40
00:02:59,240 --> 00:03:00,060
she vanished without a trace,

41
00:03:00,080 --> 00:03:00,980
afraid to show her face.

42
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:03,060
I wonder what she's hiding.

43
00:03:03,280 --> 00:03:04,130
Master Cang.

44
00:03:04,470 --> 00:03:05,690
How dare you question a deity?

45
00:03:08,710 --> 00:03:10,850
The Saintess is in seclusion.

46
00:03:11,190 --> 00:03:12,060
She's already sent word

47
00:03:12,280 --> 00:03:13,600
that once she emerges,

48
00:03:13,750 --> 00:03:15,240
she'll prove her divine status

49
00:03:15,240 --> 00:03:16,260
to all the immortal sects.

50
00:03:17,080 --> 00:03:18,730
The sect leaders' concerns

51
00:03:18,910 --> 00:03:19,890
are understandable.

52
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:22,980
We can hand over the Sect Leaders' Tokens then.

53
00:03:23,470 --> 00:03:24,170
There's no rush.

54
00:03:27,590 --> 00:03:28,540
High Immortal Danshen,

55
00:03:29,310 --> 00:03:31,290
our top priority now

56
00:03:31,840 --> 00:03:33,370
should be cleaning house

57
00:03:33,750 --> 00:03:35,290
and rooting out the traitor among us.

58
00:03:35,710 --> 00:03:37,780
Your disciple conspired with Qi Fengyin

59
00:03:37,910 --> 00:03:39,940
and repeatedly helped that devil harm the immortal sects.

60
00:03:40,150 --> 00:03:42,060
I hope you'll execute the traitor yourself...

61
00:03:42,150 --> 00:03:42,660
Yinhua!

62
00:03:43,080 --> 00:03:43,730
Show some respect!

63
00:03:44,560 --> 00:03:46,010
Yamao may have committed a grave offense,

64
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:47,220
but she's still

65
00:03:47,310 --> 00:03:48,940
High Immortal Danshen's disciple.

66
00:03:49,150 --> 00:03:49,850
I say

67
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:51,690
we should just imprison her.

68
00:03:52,240 --> 00:03:53,610
There's no need to kill her.

69
00:03:54,120 --> 00:03:54,890
I disagree.

70
00:03:55,360 --> 00:03:56,980
Precisely because she's his disciple,

71
00:03:57,000 --> 00:03:58,570
he should set an example.

72
00:03:59,190 --> 00:04:00,340
This concerns the possible arrival of the Devil Incarnate.

73
00:04:00,520 --> 00:04:01,410
If we don't punish her severely,

74
00:04:01,710 --> 00:04:02,340
how can we earn everyone's trust?

75
00:04:02,360 --> 00:04:04,060
If that girl hadn't caused so much trouble,

76
00:04:04,360 --> 00:04:05,010
the sects

77
00:04:05,120 --> 00:04:07,130
would've joined forces to kill Qi Fengyin long ago.

78
00:04:07,520 --> 00:04:09,100
Her crimes are unforgivable.

79
00:04:09,240 --> 00:04:10,170
High Immortal Danshen,

80
00:04:10,310 --> 00:04:11,170
if you keep protecting her,

81
00:04:11,430 --> 00:04:12,850
you'll be making an enemy of every sect.

82
00:04:12,960 --> 00:04:14,130
If you can't bring yourself to do it,

83
00:04:14,470 --> 00:04:14,980
I will!

84
00:04:16,950 --> 00:04:17,810
I'm right here.

85
00:04:26,430 --> 00:04:27,370
- What's that? - What?

86
00:04:32,160 --> 00:04:33,340
If you've got a problem, take it up with me.

87
00:04:34,950 --> 00:04:36,140
Leave my master out of this.

88
00:04:38,630 --> 00:04:39,490
You traitor!

89
00:04:39,680 --> 00:04:40,930
You've got some nerve showing your face!

90
00:04:44,630 --> 00:04:45,880
What makes me a traitor?

91
00:04:46,510 --> 00:04:47,570
You were the ones who tried to kill me

92
00:04:47,570 --> 00:04:48,540
and take my herb core first.

93
00:04:49,510 --> 00:04:50,630
I've never harmed

94
00:04:50,630 --> 00:04:51,340
a single one of you!

95
00:05:02,870 --> 00:05:03,580
Master.

96
00:05:04,360 --> 00:05:04,960
Yamao.

97
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:06,410
I'm your master.

98
00:05:06,750 --> 00:05:08,490
I don't need you to protect me.

99
00:05:22,120 --> 00:05:22,900
Didn't you all just

100
00:05:22,920 --> 00:05:24,100
ask for my decision?

101
00:05:25,120 --> 00:05:26,700
Everything she did

102
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:27,700
was for me.

103
00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:29,170
Yet you tormented her

104
00:05:29,390 --> 00:05:30,730
and tried to take her herb core.

105
00:05:31,190 --> 00:05:32,050
Now tell me,

106
00:05:33,240 --> 00:05:34,610
who's going to answer for that?

107
00:05:37,040 --> 00:05:38,250
I'm willing to overlook

108
00:05:38,830 --> 00:05:39,810
what happened before.

109
00:05:40,510 --> 00:05:41,610
But from now on,

110
00:05:42,070 --> 00:05:43,410
if anyone tries to hurt my disciple,

111
00:05:43,750 --> 00:05:45,410
you'll have to get past me first.

112
00:06:01,720 --> 00:06:02,490
Esteemed sect leaders,

113
00:06:03,310 --> 00:06:04,900
everything Yamao did

114
00:06:05,430 --> 00:06:06,660
was to save her master.

115
00:06:07,270 --> 00:06:09,050
Now that High Immortal Danshen has returned,

116
00:06:09,830 --> 00:06:10,340
I'm certain

117
00:06:10,750 --> 00:06:12,900
she'll have nothing more to do with Qi Fengyin.

118
00:06:13,160 --> 00:06:13,810
So I ask you all,

119
00:06:15,040 --> 00:06:16,100
please stop pressuring them.

120
00:06:40,600 --> 00:06:41,100
What's wrong?

121
00:06:41,750 --> 00:06:43,020
It's only been a little while.

122
00:06:43,630 --> 00:06:44,660
How come my little disciple

123
00:06:45,240 --> 00:06:46,140
has gotten so quiet?

124
00:06:51,310 --> 00:06:52,980
Master!

125
00:06:53,870 --> 00:06:55,030
Do you have any idea

126
00:06:55,030 --> 00:06:56,530
how much I went through

127
00:06:56,530 --> 00:06:57,700
to save you?

128
00:06:58,270 --> 00:07:00,100
I tried everything I could!

129
00:07:00,830 --> 00:07:01,660
So many times,

130
00:07:02,190 --> 00:07:04,290
I nearly lost my life!

131
00:07:05,160 --> 00:07:07,020
Sometimes, I thought there was no hope.

132
00:07:07,510 --> 00:07:09,700
I even wanted to die with you!

133
00:07:10,160 --> 00:07:11,610
Master!

134
00:07:12,390 --> 00:07:13,020
There, there.

135
00:07:13,630 --> 00:07:14,220
I know.

136
00:07:14,750 --> 00:07:16,250
While I was gone,

137
00:07:16,720 --> 00:07:17,980
you suffered so much.

138
00:07:22,070 --> 00:07:23,410
And you were treated even worse.

139
00:07:24,040 --> 00:07:25,250
You've done so much for the immortal sects.

140
00:07:25,870 --> 00:07:27,370
Yet they left you to die.

141
00:07:28,160 --> 00:07:29,460
All they wanted was to kill me for my herb core.

142
00:07:30,070 --> 00:07:31,700
I barely survived bringing you back.

143
00:07:32,750 --> 00:07:34,100
And they still tried to make you kill me!

144
00:07:37,390 --> 00:07:37,980
Let me take a look.

145
00:07:38,800 --> 00:07:39,850
Once we've both recovered,

146
00:07:40,270 --> 00:07:40,780
you'll have

147
00:07:41,120 --> 00:07:42,290
plenty of time to tell me all about it.

148
00:07:44,240 --> 00:07:45,100
After everything we've been through,

149
00:07:45,390 --> 00:07:46,100
I promise you

150
00:07:46,560 --> 00:07:48,410
I'll be more careful from now on.

151
00:07:48,950 --> 00:07:49,900
I won't ever

152
00:07:50,240 --> 00:07:51,220
leave you alone so easily again.

153
00:07:52,270 --> 00:07:53,490
You'd better keep that promise.

154
00:07:55,920 --> 00:07:56,610
I will.

155
00:07:58,750 --> 00:07:59,170
All right.

156
00:07:59,630 --> 00:08:00,410
Now get some rest.

157
00:08:07,390 --> 00:08:08,050
Master.

158
00:08:09,830 --> 00:08:11,250
I have another friend

159
00:08:11,250 --> 00:08:12,540
in Wuchang Prison. She...

160
00:08:12,630 --> 00:08:13,810
Yuwen Hao has taken care of everything.

161
00:08:14,390 --> 00:08:14,850
Don't worry.

162
00:08:17,920 --> 00:08:19,660
Then, since you've returned to the present,

163
00:08:19,920 --> 00:08:21,580
have you seen Qi Fengyin again?

164
00:08:27,160 --> 00:08:28,220
Your wounds haven't healed.

165
00:08:28,600 --> 00:08:30,290
You shouldn't be worrying about any of that.

166
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:31,100
But...

167
00:08:31,120 --> 00:08:31,910
Get some sleep.

168
00:08:54,240 --> 00:08:54,940
Hao.

169
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:56,610
Your injuries...

170
00:08:56,870 --> 00:08:57,420
Kneel.

171
00:08:58,030 --> 00:08:59,130
Hao...

172
00:09:01,320 --> 00:09:03,010
You've disobeyed my orders time and again.

173
00:09:04,150 --> 00:09:05,650
You even used a spell to stop me in Wuchang Prison.

174
00:09:05,840 --> 00:09:07,530
Did you think I wouldn't hold you accountable?

175
00:09:08,960 --> 00:09:10,820
I was trying to kill Qi Fengyin.

176
00:09:11,270 --> 00:09:12,940
Then why did you try to kill Yamao?

177
00:09:13,750 --> 00:09:15,100
She's a traitor to the immortal sects.

178
00:09:15,440 --> 00:09:16,820
She deceived every one of us

179
00:09:17,480 --> 00:09:19,220
and even brought Qi Fengyin to Mount Zhaowu!

180
00:09:19,870 --> 00:09:21,370
I tried to kill her for the greater good.

181
00:09:22,080 --> 00:09:22,940
What did I do wrong?

182
00:09:23,240 --> 00:09:24,730
Was it really for the greater good,

183
00:09:24,750 --> 00:09:25,770
or for your own selfish reasons?

184
00:09:27,840 --> 00:09:29,580
How long have you even known her?

185
00:09:30,240 --> 00:09:30,860
And you're scolding me

186
00:09:30,860 --> 00:09:32,700
over that wicked demon girl?

187
00:09:33,510 --> 00:09:34,010
Kneel.

188
00:09:43,240 --> 00:09:44,490
Even if the person you tried to kill

189
00:09:44,510 --> 00:09:45,180
hadn't been Yamao,

190
00:09:47,150 --> 00:09:48,300
I still wouldn't let you

191
00:09:48,320 --> 00:09:49,100
do whatever you please.

192
00:09:50,550 --> 00:09:51,220
Master Yuwen.

193
00:09:53,240 --> 00:09:54,820
Do you even believe that yourself?

194
00:09:56,030 --> 00:09:57,730
You're the one who lost your spiritual mark.

195
00:09:58,440 --> 00:09:59,700
You insist it was an accident.

196
00:10:00,080 --> 00:10:01,700
But if your faith hadn't wavered,

197
00:10:02,150 --> 00:10:03,580
how could she have taken advantage of you?

198
00:10:03,960 --> 00:10:05,700
Our master fell victim to his inner demons.

199
00:10:06,080 --> 00:10:07,130
How could I stand by

200
00:10:07,150 --> 00:10:07,980
and let you suffer the same fate?

201
00:10:08,960 --> 00:10:10,220
Everything I've done

202
00:10:11,030 --> 00:10:12,770
was to rid you of your inner demons

203
00:10:13,280 --> 00:10:14,540
and strengthen your faith in the immortal path.

204
00:10:16,080 --> 00:10:17,060
If it's my path,

205
00:10:20,630 --> 00:10:22,330
what business is it of yours?

206
00:10:28,630 --> 00:10:29,220
This is my fault.

207
00:10:30,750 --> 00:10:32,220
I've been too lenient with you lately.

208
00:10:32,670 --> 00:10:33,700
You're confined to your room for three months.

209
00:10:34,270 --> 00:10:35,650
You are not to set foot outside.

210
00:10:45,120 --> 00:10:45,850
I now

211
00:10:47,320 --> 00:10:48,980
serve the Saintess of the Tides.

212
00:10:49,720 --> 00:10:50,730
I'm no longer under your authority.

213
00:10:51,240 --> 00:10:52,060
Master Yuwen.

214
00:10:53,790 --> 00:10:54,730
You have no right to punish me.

215
00:11:06,870 --> 00:11:07,300
Yinhua!

216
00:11:07,550 --> 00:11:08,010
Yinhua!

217
00:11:09,030 --> 00:11:10,300
I haven't done anything wrong!

218
00:11:10,480 --> 00:11:11,460
The one who committed those terrible crimes

219
00:11:11,480 --> 00:11:12,060
was Yamao!

220
00:11:12,480 --> 00:11:13,940
Why does Hao keep defending her?

221
00:11:14,080 --> 00:11:15,300
You're taking this too far.

222
00:11:15,910 --> 00:11:17,300
Ever since we met Yamao,

223
00:11:17,480 --> 00:11:18,100
has she ever done anything

224
00:11:18,120 --> 00:11:19,220
truly wicked?

225
00:11:21,150 --> 00:11:22,700
Even you are saying that?

226
00:11:24,000 --> 00:11:24,820
Have you forgotten

227
00:11:25,390 --> 00:11:27,010
everything Hao has done for us?

228
00:11:27,480 --> 00:11:29,180
Will you just let him end up like our master?

229
00:11:29,600 --> 00:11:30,780
That's not what I meant.

230
00:11:30,780 --> 00:11:31,580
And you!

231
00:11:32,480 --> 00:11:33,530
How did you manage

232
00:11:33,550 --> 00:11:34,700
to earn that demon girl's trust

233
00:11:35,150 --> 00:11:36,770
and get her to send you 900 years into the past?

234
00:11:37,720 --> 00:11:38,420
Yinhua.

235
00:11:38,550 --> 00:11:39,820
I think you've misunderstood Youyou.

236
00:11:39,960 --> 00:11:40,940
She never wanted to hurt anyone.

237
00:11:41,200 --> 00:11:42,770
It's not that she won't. She can't!

238
00:11:43,550 --> 00:11:44,770
If she regains her demonic core,

239
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:45,680
do you really think she'll

240
00:11:45,680 --> 00:11:47,300
still treat you this kindly?

241
00:11:47,790 --> 00:11:48,610
Don't forget.

242
00:11:49,390 --> 00:11:50,850
She serves Qi Fengyin.

243
00:11:51,240 --> 00:11:52,420
Do I really need to remind you

244
00:11:52,440 --> 00:11:53,460
what kind of man Qi Fengyin is?

245
00:11:57,550 --> 00:11:58,490
Our family ties

246
00:12:00,030 --> 00:12:00,980
are dead and gone.

247
00:12:04,480 --> 00:12:05,300
Qingxing.

248
00:12:06,200 --> 00:12:06,980
You used to be

249
00:12:08,200 --> 00:12:08,820
a coward.

250
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:11,300
You couldn't protect anyone.

251
00:12:12,790 --> 00:12:14,300
Don't think you can lecture me now.

252
00:12:15,390 --> 00:12:16,650
I know exactly what I'm doing.

253
00:12:17,870 --> 00:12:18,180
Yin...

254
00:12:41,030 --> 00:12:41,820
Qingxing.

255
00:12:45,390 --> 00:12:46,010
Qingxing?

256
00:12:58,440 --> 00:12:58,940
What's wrong?

257
00:13:02,270 --> 00:13:03,490
You seem worried about something.

258
00:13:04,670 --> 00:13:05,180
No.

259
00:13:06,030 --> 00:13:06,580
It's nothing.

260
00:13:07,080 --> 00:13:08,490
Then hurry up and draw!

261
00:13:09,360 --> 00:13:10,100
Once you've finished

262
00:13:10,120 --> 00:13:11,180
that little array,

263
00:13:11,550 --> 00:13:12,890
I can sneak out of Wuchang Prison, right?

264
00:13:19,750 --> 00:13:20,180
Youyou.

265
00:13:22,510 --> 00:13:23,700
Do you think

266
00:13:23,960 --> 00:13:24,650
Qi Fengyin...

267
00:13:27,790 --> 00:13:29,890
might hurt Yamao?

268
00:13:36,910 --> 00:13:38,180
I knew you were clueless.

269
00:13:38,630 --> 00:13:39,650
Think about it.

270
00:13:39,870 --> 00:13:41,250
His Lordship has such a bad temper,

271
00:13:41,600 --> 00:13:42,980
yet he puts up with Yamao's antics

272
00:13:43,270 --> 00:13:44,530
without ever losing his patience.

273
00:13:44,960 --> 00:13:46,100
If Yamao

274
00:13:46,120 --> 00:13:47,100
ever got hurt,

275
00:13:47,360 --> 00:13:48,420
he'd be more worried than anyone.

276
00:13:50,320 --> 00:13:51,650
Maybe that's because Yamao

277
00:13:52,150 --> 00:13:54,370
has never crossed his line.

278
00:13:56,270 --> 00:13:57,580
What are you mumbling about?

279
00:13:58,150 --> 00:13:58,980
Forget that.

280
00:13:59,270 --> 00:14:00,180
My Demon Soul Talisman.

281
00:14:00,200 --> 00:14:00,980
Did you get it back?

282
00:14:01,480 --> 00:14:02,460
Once my demonic power

283
00:14:02,480 --> 00:14:03,130
is restored,

284
00:14:03,360 --> 00:14:04,460
I won't need your silly array.

285
00:14:04,630 --> 00:14:06,000
I'll smash right through this prison!

286
00:14:08,720 --> 00:14:10,000
And be free again.

287
00:14:25,370 --> 00:14:26,100
Yamao...

288
00:14:27,630 --> 00:14:28,390
Yamao!

289
00:14:29,440 --> 00:14:30,420
Wake up!

290
00:14:31,510 --> 00:14:32,370
You're awake!

291
00:14:32,720 --> 00:14:33,460
Youyou?

292
00:14:33,840 --> 00:14:34,700
Thank goodness you're awake!

293
00:14:34,750 --> 00:14:35,770
Thank goodness!

294
00:14:35,870 --> 00:14:37,300
You scared me!

295
00:14:40,120 --> 00:14:41,180
I'm sorry! I'm so sorry!

296
00:14:41,200 --> 00:14:41,890
How are you feeling?

297
00:14:42,240 --> 00:14:43,060
Are you okay?

298
00:14:44,080 --> 00:14:45,730
What's wrong with you?

299
00:14:46,080 --> 00:14:46,850
I sent you away

300
00:14:46,870 --> 00:14:48,300
to keep you safe!

301
00:14:48,480 --> 00:14:49,530
How did your injuries get

302
00:14:49,550 --> 00:14:50,650
even worse than before?

303
00:14:51,080 --> 00:14:51,730
Tell me.

304
00:14:52,080 --> 00:14:52,730
Who did this to you?

305
00:14:53,200 --> 00:14:54,300
I'll make them pay!

306
00:14:58,870 --> 00:14:59,580
I'm fine.

307
00:14:59,870 --> 00:15:00,770
Stop acting like

308
00:15:00,790 --> 00:15:01,610
I'm on my deathbed.

309
00:15:01,870 --> 00:15:03,250
My master's healing me now.

310
00:15:03,510 --> 00:15:05,010
My vital energy wasn't seriously damaged.

311
00:15:05,320 --> 00:15:06,370
I'll be fine after a couple days' rest.

312
00:15:07,550 --> 00:15:08,610
Easy for you to say.

313
00:15:10,510 --> 00:15:11,580
Then let me take a bite.

314
00:15:11,910 --> 00:15:13,220
That'll prove you're really okay.

315
00:15:14,440 --> 00:15:15,180
What are you doing?

316
00:15:15,440 --> 00:15:16,100
All right, fine.

317
00:15:16,670 --> 00:15:17,940
I saw how much you suffered

318
00:15:18,030 --> 00:15:18,940
using the talisman so many times.

319
00:15:19,240 --> 00:15:20,370
I was going to go easy on you.

320
00:15:20,670 --> 00:15:21,490
But clearly,

321
00:15:21,870 --> 00:15:22,850
I was worried for nothing.

322
00:15:24,550 --> 00:15:24,940
So...

323
00:15:25,750 --> 00:15:27,010
when you went 900 years into the past,

324
00:15:27,080 --> 00:15:27,820
did you see me?

325
00:15:28,270 --> 00:15:29,180
Was I amazing?

326
00:15:37,600 --> 00:15:38,420
Absolutely.

327
00:15:38,630 --> 00:15:40,130
You were a mighty ancient demon,

328
00:15:40,320 --> 00:15:41,340
wielding a priceless treasure,

329
00:15:41,480 --> 00:15:42,490
commanding demons far and wide.

330
00:15:42,750 --> 00:15:43,850
A hundred thousand demons

331
00:15:43,850 --> 00:15:45,630
bowed down before you.

332
00:15:45,840 --> 00:15:46,770
You were incredible.

333
00:15:47,720 --> 00:15:48,530
The entire Demon Capital

334
00:15:48,750 --> 00:15:49,770
answered to you alone.

335
00:15:50,240 --> 00:15:51,490
See? I told you I wasn't bragging!

336
00:15:53,270 --> 00:15:54,060
It's just a shame

337
00:15:54,080 --> 00:15:55,180
you couldn't bring my talisman back.

338
00:15:55,440 --> 00:15:56,060
But that's okay.

339
00:15:56,360 --> 00:15:57,250
As long as you're both safe.

340
00:15:59,240 --> 00:16:00,820
Maybe the time just wasn't right.

341
00:16:02,200 --> 00:16:03,250
What about His Lordship?

342
00:16:04,120 --> 00:16:04,650
Qingxing,

343
00:16:05,200 --> 00:16:06,130
didn't you say

344
00:16:06,150 --> 00:16:06,850
his Wanjun Lock

345
00:16:06,870 --> 00:16:07,890
had been broken?

346
00:16:08,080 --> 00:16:08,890
You're hurt this badly.

347
00:16:08,910 --> 00:16:09,890
Why isn't he looking after you?

348
00:16:10,120 --> 00:16:11,700
Leaving both of us on our own

349
00:16:12,030 --> 00:16:13,300
isn't like him at all.

350
00:16:14,670 --> 00:16:16,530
Don't tell me he's still 900 years in the past!

351
00:16:16,630 --> 00:16:17,730
Since we returned to the present,

352
00:16:18,200 --> 00:16:19,580
there's been no sign of Qi Fengyin.

353
00:16:23,390 --> 00:16:24,850
Maybe it's because I told him

354
00:16:25,320 --> 00:16:26,530
that once the Wanjun Lock was broken,

355
00:16:27,270 --> 00:16:28,300
we'd go our separate ways.

356
00:16:29,720 --> 00:16:31,180
What were you thinking?

357
00:16:32,240 --> 00:16:33,370
Things were going so well.

358
00:16:33,550 --> 00:16:34,730
Why would you want to split up?

359
00:16:34,910 --> 00:16:36,490
His Lordship is missing.

360
00:16:37,000 --> 00:16:37,940
You can't just abandon him now

361
00:16:37,940 --> 00:16:38,770
that your master's back.

362
00:16:39,000 --> 00:16:40,720
You can't just use him and walk away.

363
00:16:41,120 --> 00:16:41,610
I don't care.

364
00:16:42,360 --> 00:16:43,610
Once your injuries have healed,

365
00:16:43,960 --> 00:16:45,420
you're coming with me to find His Lordship.

366
00:16:46,200 --> 00:16:47,100
The array in Wuchang Prison

367
00:16:47,120 --> 00:16:47,890
is about to wear off.

368
00:16:48,120 --> 00:16:48,980
If Youyou doesn't get back soon,

369
00:16:49,360 --> 00:16:50,340
she will be discovered.

370
00:16:50,720 --> 00:16:51,610
She's still a convicted demon.

371
00:16:52,120 --> 00:16:53,530
She snuck out this time.

372
00:16:53,960 --> 00:16:55,820
I'll bring her to see you again tomorrow.

373
00:16:56,630 --> 00:16:57,850
I'll help you take her back.

374
00:17:00,390 --> 00:17:01,820
And you said we'd go our separate ways.

375
00:17:02,270 --> 00:17:03,130
We've barely been apart,

376
00:17:03,150 --> 00:17:03,770
and you're already clinging to me.

377
00:17:05,680 --> 00:17:06,900
I'm simply irresistible.

378
00:17:07,160 --> 00:17:07,900
Everyone adores me.

379
00:17:08,920 --> 00:17:09,770
That's right.

380
00:17:10,440 --> 00:17:11,570
I don't often get a chance

381
00:17:12,070 --> 00:17:13,180
to personally throw you

382
00:17:13,480 --> 00:17:14,250
back in prison.

383
00:17:22,640 --> 00:17:24,570
Thank you for keeping quiet

384
00:17:24,960 --> 00:17:25,940
about Yinhua earlier.

385
00:17:27,110 --> 00:17:28,700
Knowing Youyou's temper,

386
00:17:28,790 --> 00:17:29,810
I never would've been able to stop her.

387
00:17:30,030 --> 00:17:31,980
Yinhua made a terrible mistake this time.

388
00:17:32,590 --> 00:17:33,570
As her older brother,

389
00:17:33,880 --> 00:17:34,730
I should take responsibility for her.

390
00:17:35,030 --> 00:17:36,220
What happened between Yinhua and me

391
00:17:36,680 --> 00:17:37,770
is something I'll settle with her later.

392
00:17:38,200 --> 00:17:38,900
As far as I'm concerned,

393
00:17:39,200 --> 00:17:40,660
no one pays for someone else's mistakes.

394
00:17:41,880 --> 00:17:42,940
That's not why

395
00:17:43,440 --> 00:17:44,810
I followed you out here.

396
00:17:45,640 --> 00:17:46,460
You want to know

397
00:17:46,920 --> 00:17:48,660
why I didn't return the Demon Soul Talisman

398
00:17:49,000 --> 00:17:49,730
to Youyou

399
00:17:50,000 --> 00:17:50,810
even though I got it back?

400
00:17:51,160 --> 00:17:52,090
You're worried

401
00:17:52,440 --> 00:17:53,860
the talisman might awaken her demonic nature

402
00:17:54,160 --> 00:17:55,090
and make her lose control?

403
00:17:57,640 --> 00:17:59,300
Besides, she's already forgotten

404
00:17:59,300 --> 00:18:00,480
Shen Wangyan and the Demon Capital.

405
00:18:01,110 --> 00:18:02,420
If she gets the talisman back,

406
00:18:02,920 --> 00:18:03,620
I'm afraid remembering

407
00:18:03,620 --> 00:18:04,860
her past will break her.

408
00:18:05,240 --> 00:18:05,770
She's been given

409
00:18:06,200 --> 00:18:07,810
a second chance at life.

410
00:18:08,030 --> 00:18:08,420
Maybe it's best

411
00:18:08,750 --> 00:18:09,910
to leave her past sins

412
00:18:09,910 --> 00:18:10,810
and suffering behind.

413
00:18:17,520 --> 00:18:18,110
I want

414
00:18:18,310 --> 00:18:19,380
to use our sect's cultivation techniques

415
00:18:19,830 --> 00:18:20,490
to purify

416
00:18:20,550 --> 00:18:21,810
the blood energy in the Demon Soul Talisman.

417
00:18:21,960 --> 00:18:22,530
That way,

418
00:18:22,960 --> 00:18:24,050
it won't affect her.

419
00:18:24,790 --> 00:18:25,570
And when the time comes,

420
00:18:25,640 --> 00:18:26,700
she can make her own choice.

421
00:18:27,070 --> 00:18:27,460
Whether to

422
00:18:28,070 --> 00:18:28,810
accept the talisman.

423
00:18:32,720 --> 00:18:33,700
I never expected

424
00:18:33,920 --> 00:18:35,380
you'd think this through so carefully.

425
00:18:37,400 --> 00:18:39,140
Youyou is a sweet girl.

426
00:18:39,680 --> 00:18:40,610
Sure, sometimes

427
00:18:40,720 --> 00:18:41,620
she can be a little mischievous,

428
00:18:42,030 --> 00:18:42,860
but her good side far outweighs the bad.

429
00:18:44,550 --> 00:18:45,290
900 years ago,

430
00:18:45,480 --> 00:18:46,570
I failed to keep my promise to you.

431
00:18:46,590 --> 00:18:47,490
I didn't protect her.

432
00:18:48,960 --> 00:18:49,810
But from now on,

433
00:18:50,200 --> 00:18:51,400
I'll do everything I can

434
00:18:51,400 --> 00:18:52,140
to make it up to her.

435
00:18:56,070 --> 00:18:56,890
Oh, and Yamao,

436
00:18:57,240 --> 00:18:57,900
there's one more thing.

437
00:18:59,030 --> 00:19:00,090
You're in a delicate position right now.

438
00:19:00,880 --> 00:19:02,250
You should stay away from Qi Fengyin.

439
00:19:04,510 --> 00:19:05,090
I know.

440
00:19:06,070 --> 00:19:07,690
It's only because Master and Hao

441
00:19:07,720 --> 00:19:08,490
stood up for me

442
00:19:08,920 --> 00:19:10,220
that I'm allowed to stay here and recover.

443
00:19:11,240 --> 00:19:12,050
If I

444
00:19:12,480 --> 00:19:13,900
get involved with Qi Fengyin again,

445
00:19:14,880 --> 00:19:15,810
I might drag them into trouble.

446
00:19:21,400 --> 00:19:23,290
But if he's already broken the Wanjun Lock,

447
00:19:24,240 --> 00:19:25,250
why did he still look

448
00:19:25,270 --> 00:19:25,980
so weak?

449
00:19:27,270 --> 00:19:29,090
Was it really just a dream?

450
00:19:49,880 --> 00:19:50,940
Yamao once fell

451
00:19:50,960 --> 00:19:52,250
deep into Du Zhong's sea of consciousness.

452
00:19:53,000 --> 00:19:54,530
She faced something similar back then.

453
00:20:15,590 --> 00:20:16,250
I suppose

454
00:20:16,880 --> 00:20:17,460
it's because

455
00:20:17,480 --> 00:20:18,700
Duyao's illusion wounded me,

456
00:20:19,510 --> 00:20:21,140
and I forced Mount Jigu's flames to go out.

457
00:20:22,310 --> 00:20:23,010
I'm too weak right now

458
00:20:23,440 --> 00:20:24,770
to break through this illusion.

459
00:20:34,680 --> 00:20:36,290
At least the Wanjun Lock is broken.

460
00:20:37,070 --> 00:20:38,420
Once I've rested and regained my strength,

461
00:20:39,110 --> 00:20:40,460
I can break free of this place.

462
00:20:42,030 --> 00:20:43,660
Only I can heal Yamao's wounds.

463
00:20:44,160 --> 00:20:45,180
Let me take her back.

464
00:20:48,720 --> 00:20:50,180
I wonder how she's doing.

465
00:20:52,400 --> 00:20:53,860
Did Danshen keep his promise

466
00:20:54,680 --> 00:20:55,490
and heal her?

467
00:21:07,550 --> 00:21:08,180
Master.

468
00:21:08,480 --> 00:21:09,810
I'm feeling much better now.

469
00:21:10,200 --> 00:21:11,700
Besides, my body is different.

470
00:21:12,030 --> 00:21:13,460
A little moonlight will heal me right up.

471
00:21:14,480 --> 00:21:15,330
You, on the other hand,

472
00:21:15,750 --> 00:21:16,860
have only just regained your human form.

473
00:21:17,030 --> 00:21:17,980
You should be resting.

474
00:21:18,590 --> 00:21:19,980
Don't waste your cultivation on me.

475
00:21:20,160 --> 00:21:21,140
How could healing you

476
00:21:21,640 --> 00:21:23,180
ever be a waste?

477
00:21:26,000 --> 00:21:27,290
But I'd much rather

478
00:21:27,350 --> 00:21:28,220
you get some proper rest.

479
00:21:29,750 --> 00:21:31,340
If you wear yourself out,

480
00:21:31,510 --> 00:21:32,900
I'll have to use spirit essence to save you again.

481
00:21:33,240 --> 00:21:34,620
If we keep saving each other like this,

482
00:21:34,750 --> 00:21:36,040
when will it ever end?

483
00:21:38,060 --> 00:21:38,500
All right.

484
00:21:38,920 --> 00:21:39,900
I promise I'll rest.

485
00:21:40,270 --> 00:21:40,770
But

486
00:21:41,030 --> 00:21:41,900
while I'm recovering,

487
00:21:42,180 --> 00:21:43,170
you must stay out of trouble too.

488
00:21:43,380 --> 00:21:44,730
Qi Fengyin is still missing.

489
00:21:45,030 --> 00:21:46,090
Things are tense right now.

490
00:21:46,590 --> 00:21:47,860
Don't go stirring up trouble.

491
00:21:49,880 --> 00:21:50,570
Master.

492
00:21:51,720 --> 00:21:52,770
Actually, Qi Fengyin

493
00:21:52,960 --> 00:21:54,140
isn't like the rumors say.

494
00:21:55,030 --> 00:21:56,460
He traveled with me all this time.

495
00:21:56,920 --> 00:21:57,980
He never killed innocent people.

496
00:21:58,400 --> 00:21:59,900
In fact, he kept helping me.

497
00:22:00,310 --> 00:22:01,220
He even helped me save you.

498
00:22:01,750 --> 00:22:04,460
That's why I don't think the firestorm

499
00:22:04,720 --> 00:22:06,090
was Qi Fengyin's doing either.

500
00:22:06,400 --> 00:22:06,860
And...

501
00:22:12,480 --> 00:22:13,090
How can you say that

502
00:22:14,160 --> 00:22:15,700
and expect me not to worry?

503
00:22:19,750 --> 00:22:20,460
I'm sorry.

504
00:22:21,030 --> 00:22:22,380
I was just talking.

505
00:22:23,480 --> 00:22:24,460
Please don't be angry, Master.

506
00:22:26,110 --> 00:22:27,620
Just focus on resting and recovering.

507
00:22:31,680 --> 00:22:32,620
In a few days,

508
00:22:34,440 --> 00:22:35,700
we'll return to Luoshen Valley.

509
00:22:40,200 --> 00:22:41,010
Get some rest.

510
00:22:52,920 --> 00:22:54,810
The flames of Mount Jigu are vicious.

511
00:22:55,480 --> 00:22:56,380
My wounds have already healed,

512
00:22:56,960 --> 00:22:58,420
but the pain still cuts deep.

513
00:23:27,960 --> 00:23:28,860
Qi Fengyin?

514
00:23:29,830 --> 00:23:31,140
What are you doing on Mount Zhaowu?

515
00:23:33,310 --> 00:23:34,220
Look around.

516
00:23:35,160 --> 00:23:36,420
This isn't Mount Zhaowu.

517
00:23:37,070 --> 00:23:38,050
You're dreaming.

518
00:23:47,790 --> 00:23:48,290
But...

519
00:23:48,640 --> 00:23:50,340
But I'm wide awake.

520
00:23:50,400 --> 00:23:51,810
That's because of the dark mark.

521
00:23:52,350 --> 00:23:53,460
It connects our minds,

522
00:23:53,920 --> 00:23:55,290
allowing us to meet in this dream.

523
00:23:56,160 --> 00:23:57,460
Where are you right now?

524
00:23:57,590 --> 00:23:58,770
Did you make it back to the present?

525
00:24:01,080 --> 00:24:02,140
You're the one

526
00:24:02,280 --> 00:24:03,450
who said we'd go our separate ways.

527
00:24:04,120 --> 00:24:05,690
So why do you care what happens to me?

528
00:24:07,200 --> 00:24:08,900
I... I did say that.

529
00:24:09,760 --> 00:24:10,500
But after everything,

530
00:24:10,520 --> 00:24:11,740
I did you a huge favor.

531
00:24:11,920 --> 00:24:13,290
Now that the Wanjun Lock is broken,

532
00:24:13,790 --> 00:24:15,900
you could at least thank me

533
00:24:16,560 --> 00:24:17,700
and say a proper goodbye.

534
00:24:18,470 --> 00:24:19,450
You can't just

535
00:24:19,510 --> 00:24:20,130
disappear without a word.

536
00:24:20,470 --> 00:24:21,490
If it weren't for this dark mark,

537
00:24:21,570 --> 00:24:23,060
I wouldn't even know if you were alive!

538
00:24:24,310 --> 00:24:25,260
Then take a good look.

539
00:24:25,990 --> 00:24:27,490
Do I look dead to you?

540
00:24:36,520 --> 00:24:37,730
My powers have returned.

541
00:24:38,030 --> 00:24:38,900
I'm fine now.

542
00:24:39,160 --> 00:24:40,220
Instead of worrying about me,

543
00:24:40,280 --> 00:24:41,410
you should worry about yourself.

544
00:24:44,350 --> 00:24:44,940
Right.

545
00:24:45,880 --> 00:24:47,410
You're back at full strength now.

546
00:24:47,880 --> 00:24:48,650
No one can beat you.

547
00:24:50,390 --> 00:24:51,610
Meanwhile, I'm a complete mess.

548
00:24:53,560 --> 00:24:54,050
Why is that?

549
00:24:55,480 --> 00:24:56,970
I've been resting since I got back.

550
00:24:57,480 --> 00:24:58,540
Most of my wounds have healed.

551
00:24:59,560 --> 00:25:00,500
But the flames of Mount Jigu

552
00:25:00,520 --> 00:25:02,090
still burn inside me.

553
00:25:02,470 --> 00:25:03,890
I can barely sleep at night.

554
00:25:04,190 --> 00:25:04,810
The pain keeps waking me up.

555
00:25:07,960 --> 00:25:08,620
Give me your hand.

556
00:25:16,910 --> 00:25:18,140
Why is your hand so cold?

557
00:25:19,000 --> 00:25:19,650
We're in a dream.

558
00:25:20,830 --> 00:25:22,170
Stop asking so many questions.

559
00:25:32,190 --> 00:25:33,140
What kind of power is this?

560
00:25:33,270 --> 00:25:34,140
It seems to be working.

561
00:25:34,440 --> 00:25:35,940
This dark energy is freezing cold.

562
00:25:36,310 --> 00:25:37,220
It should help ease

563
00:25:37,240 --> 00:25:38,580
the burning pain inside you.

564
00:25:53,110 --> 00:25:53,980
Why are you staring at me?

565
00:25:54,440 --> 00:25:55,060
Go back to sleep.

566
00:25:59,800 --> 00:26:01,650
But you said we're in a dream.

567
00:26:01,750 --> 00:26:03,060
That means I'm already asleep.

568
00:26:03,240 --> 00:26:04,090
How am I supposed to sleep again?

569
00:26:06,200 --> 00:26:07,060
Close your eyes.

570
00:26:24,240 --> 00:26:25,900
Hao blames me.

571
00:26:30,760 --> 00:26:32,690
Even my own brother has turned against me.

572
00:26:44,270 --> 00:26:45,850
Was I really wrong?

573
00:26:50,830 --> 00:26:51,690
What good will crying do?

574
00:26:53,870 --> 00:26:55,650
If you can't stand by your own convictions,

575
00:26:56,110 --> 00:26:57,570
how can you hope to succeed?

576
00:26:59,590 --> 00:27:00,780
You're a revered deity.

577
00:27:01,870 --> 00:27:02,650
Every living being in the world

578
00:27:02,670 --> 00:27:03,970
bows down before you.

579
00:27:04,390 --> 00:27:05,340
Of course it's easy

580
00:27:05,340 --> 00:27:06,180
for you to say that.

581
00:27:06,550 --> 00:27:08,300
You don't know how lonely it feels

582
00:27:08,640 --> 00:27:09,740
to be misunderstood by everyone you love.

583
00:27:14,320 --> 00:27:15,130
Forgive me. I was wrong.

584
00:27:17,270 --> 00:27:17,970
Get up.

585
00:27:28,150 --> 00:27:28,970
If you know

586
00:27:28,990 --> 00:27:30,300
everything you've done

587
00:27:30,640 --> 00:27:32,180
was for someone you care about,

588
00:27:32,710 --> 00:27:34,340
why do you need anyone's approval?

589
00:27:34,960 --> 00:27:35,970
Whether they're strangers

590
00:27:36,360 --> 00:27:37,460
or your own family,

591
00:27:39,360 --> 00:27:40,620
even the person you love,

592
00:27:41,390 --> 00:27:42,460
it doesn't matter

593
00:27:43,040 --> 00:27:44,530
if they understand you or not.

594
00:28:08,640 --> 00:28:09,340
Yamao.

595
00:28:10,990 --> 00:28:11,570
What's wrong?

596
00:28:11,920 --> 00:28:13,690
I sense a powerful, murderous aura.

597
00:28:14,230 --> 00:28:15,450
I think it's coming for you.

598
00:28:17,230 --> 00:28:17,770
What?

599
00:28:19,230 --> 00:28:20,130
If Master

600
00:28:20,150 --> 00:28:21,180
and Hao hadn't stood up for me,

601
00:28:21,710 --> 00:28:23,100
even more people would be after my life.

602
00:28:25,230 --> 00:28:27,210
This murderous aura is no ordinary threat.

603
00:28:28,230 --> 00:28:29,010
I can't leave you unprotected.

604
00:28:46,470 --> 00:28:47,420
I take a wisp of my primal spirit

605
00:28:48,080 --> 00:28:49,100
and turn it into this soul whistle.

606
00:28:50,790 --> 00:28:51,980
You can take it out of this dream.

607
00:28:52,470 --> 00:28:53,890
If you ever run into trouble,

608
00:28:54,200 --> 00:28:55,130
just blow the whistle,

609
00:28:55,710 --> 00:28:57,060
and I'll appear before you.

610
00:28:57,080 --> 00:28:57,980
You can't just tear off

611
00:28:58,000 --> 00:28:58,810
a piece of your primal spirit!

612
00:28:59,270 --> 00:29:00,540
That murderous aura you mentioned?

613
00:29:00,680 --> 00:29:01,940
I'll find a way to avoid it myself.

614
00:29:02,000 --> 00:29:02,860
Take this back.

615
00:29:03,200 --> 00:29:03,860
Without me,

616
00:29:04,200 --> 00:29:05,100
you can't even sense

617
00:29:05,120 --> 00:29:05,980
where that aura is.

618
00:29:06,830 --> 00:29:07,620
How will you avoid it?

619
00:29:11,640 --> 00:29:13,980
I'm not in a position

620
00:29:15,030 --> 00:29:16,570
to come to you myself right now.

621
00:29:19,080 --> 00:29:20,620
This is the only way.

622
00:29:21,470 --> 00:29:23,010
Now that the Wanjun Lock is gone,

623
00:29:23,590 --> 00:29:24,660
my safety

624
00:29:26,590 --> 00:29:27,890
matters less than yours.

625
00:29:45,640 --> 00:29:46,530
Ever since Qi Fengyin

626
00:29:46,550 --> 00:29:47,860
broke free of the Wanjun Lock,

627
00:29:48,110 --> 00:29:49,250
he's been awfully generous.

628
00:29:50,440 --> 00:29:51,700
He gave up part of his primal spirit.

629
00:29:52,310 --> 00:29:53,660
And he's using up his dark energy.

630
00:30:03,350 --> 00:30:04,730
Master, like everyone else,

631
00:30:05,960 --> 00:30:07,250
has the wrong idea about Qi Fengyin.

632
00:30:07,830 --> 00:30:08,660
I have to find a way

633
00:30:08,680 --> 00:30:09,330
to make him understand

634
00:30:10,590 --> 00:30:11,520
that Qi Fengyin

635
00:30:12,030 --> 00:30:13,660
isn't the terrible devil everyone says he is.

636
00:30:38,270 --> 00:30:39,660
Aren't you just a spirit projection?

637
00:30:39,880 --> 00:30:40,860
How can I still touch you?

638
00:30:42,640 --> 00:30:43,770
Yamao.

639
00:30:48,440 --> 00:30:50,090
Your master hasn't come to see you today, right?

640
00:30:51,880 --> 00:30:52,490
Good.

641
00:30:53,000 --> 00:30:54,050
I wasn't finished

642
00:30:54,070 --> 00:30:54,770
telling you something yesterday.

643
00:30:55,000 --> 00:30:55,620
So today, I made sure

644
00:30:55,640 --> 00:30:56,570
to ditch Qingxing early

645
00:30:56,640 --> 00:30:57,420
and come here on my own.

646
00:30:58,440 --> 00:30:59,050
Yamao.

647
00:30:59,400 --> 00:31:00,250
His Lordship did so much

648
00:31:00,270 --> 00:31:01,900
to help you save your master.

649
00:31:02,070 --> 00:31:03,900
You can't just turn your back on him.

650
00:31:08,590 --> 00:31:09,290
What are you looking at?

651
00:31:09,310 --> 00:31:10,330
I'm talking to you.

652
00:31:11,440 --> 00:31:12,190
Neither of you

653
00:31:12,190 --> 00:31:12,940
has any sense.

654
00:31:13,200 --> 00:31:14,180
Can't you see

655
00:31:14,200 --> 00:31:15,140
His Lordship is

656
00:31:15,160 --> 00:31:16,090
the best man in the world?

657
00:31:16,310 --> 00:31:17,290
Have you forgotten

658
00:31:17,310 --> 00:31:18,330
all the ways

659
00:31:18,590 --> 00:31:19,250
he treated you differently?

660
00:31:21,400 --> 00:31:22,770
He applied medicine to your wounds himself.

661
00:31:23,240 --> 00:31:24,660
He got jealous of you and Yuwen Hao.

662
00:31:25,270 --> 00:31:26,570
He even picked fights with you for no reason.

663
00:31:26,880 --> 00:31:27,290
And another thing.

664
00:31:28,000 --> 00:31:29,220
When his dark energy went out of control,

665
00:31:29,350 --> 00:31:30,980
who could get anywhere near him?

666
00:31:31,200 --> 00:31:33,010
Wasn't it only you?

667
00:31:33,920 --> 00:31:35,050
Wasn't that because

668
00:31:35,070 --> 00:31:36,140
you always ran off at the first sign of trouble?

669
00:31:36,160 --> 00:31:37,330
Otherwise, why would I have stayed behind?

670
00:31:37,350 --> 00:31:38,770
Then what about Mount Zhaowu?

671
00:31:39,310 --> 00:31:40,330
To help you,

672
00:31:40,510 --> 00:31:41,730
His Lordship even went into the kitchen

673
00:31:41,790 --> 00:31:43,330
and cooked.

674
00:31:43,680 --> 00:31:46,100
He cried his eyes out chopping onions.

675
00:31:49,240 --> 00:31:50,800
Will you pay attention?

676
00:31:50,800 --> 00:31:52,160
I'm talking to you!

677
00:31:52,200 --> 00:31:53,090
When in his entire life

678
00:31:53,110 --> 00:31:54,490
has he ever had to put up with that?

679
00:31:54,720 --> 00:31:55,730
He even put off

680
00:31:56,030 --> 00:31:57,250
reclaiming the world's malice

681
00:31:57,270 --> 00:31:58,050
just to help you.

682
00:31:58,680 --> 00:31:59,660
Do you have any idea

683
00:31:59,680 --> 00:32:00,380
what all these things

684
00:32:00,400 --> 00:32:01,460
really mean?

685
00:32:06,200 --> 00:32:07,620
He's fallen hopelessly in love

686
00:32:07,620 --> 00:32:09,000
with you.

687
00:32:10,070 --> 00:32:11,800
I've figured it all out.

688
00:32:11,920 --> 00:32:13,090
Back on Mount Leiguan,

689
00:32:13,090 --> 00:32:14,610
when he was your inner disciple,

690
00:32:14,610 --> 00:32:15,290
you two

691
00:32:15,290 --> 00:32:16,500
sealed your love with a kiss.

692
00:32:16,500 --> 00:32:18,880
Then he quietly watched over you, full of love.

693
00:32:18,890 --> 00:32:20,430
And when you were

694
00:32:20,430 --> 00:32:21,620
running around trying to save Danshen,

695
00:32:21,790 --> 00:32:22,940
he was secretly in love,

696
00:32:23,030 --> 00:32:23,840
openly jealous,

697
00:32:23,920 --> 00:32:25,620
yet still helped you through it all.

698
00:32:26,480 --> 00:32:27,420
My poor Lordship.

699
00:32:27,960 --> 00:32:29,420
Where else could you find someone

700
00:32:29,590 --> 00:32:30,900
so loyal and devoted,

701
00:32:30,900 --> 00:32:31,980
like a lovesick puppy?

702
00:32:33,720 --> 00:32:35,450
I knew you wouldn't abandon him.

703
00:32:35,450 --> 00:32:36,220
Stop talking.

704
00:32:36,550 --> 00:32:37,960
Keep this up, and I can't protect you.

705
00:32:39,830 --> 00:32:41,640
Are you still hung up on Danshen?

706
00:32:42,590 --> 00:32:44,090
I just don't get it.

707
00:32:44,240 --> 00:32:45,980
What's Danshen got that His Lordship doesn't?

708
00:32:46,440 --> 00:32:48,860
You and His Lordship are made for each other.

709
00:32:49,030 --> 00:32:49,660
Stop it.

710
00:32:50,030 --> 00:32:51,090
Qi Fengyin is right here.

711
00:32:51,110 --> 00:32:51,980
He can hear every word.

712
00:32:53,030 --> 00:32:53,700
Where?

713
00:32:53,960 --> 00:32:54,810
Where? Where?

714
00:32:54,850 --> 00:32:55,700
Where?

715
00:32:59,720 --> 00:33:00,460
Where is he?

716
00:33:01,160 --> 00:33:01,570
Where?

717
00:33:03,880 --> 00:33:06,140
His Lordship is far too proud and powerful

718
00:33:06,140 --> 00:33:07,430
to just stroll into

719
00:33:07,430 --> 00:33:08,220
an immortal sect's territory.

720
00:33:08,750 --> 00:33:09,180
Oh, right!

721
00:33:09,510 --> 00:33:10,290
Everything I just said

722
00:33:10,310 --> 00:33:11,660
came straight from Qingxing's heart.

723
00:33:11,830 --> 00:33:12,810
He asked me to tell you.

724
00:33:12,880 --> 00:33:13,730
And I've delivered his message.

725
00:33:14,440 --> 00:33:15,570
Visiting time's up for today.

726
00:33:15,640 --> 00:33:16,250
I'd better go.

727
00:33:17,160 --> 00:33:17,860
Stop right there.

728
00:33:20,200 --> 00:33:21,180
I know I was wrong.

729
00:33:22,000 --> 00:33:22,660
She was wrong.

730
00:33:25,310 --> 00:33:26,460
I was just worried

731
00:33:26,790 --> 00:33:28,530
she might switch sides

732
00:33:28,790 --> 00:33:29,980
and join the immortal sects.

733
00:33:30,110 --> 00:33:30,460
Wait.

734
00:33:30,640 --> 00:33:31,700
Who's protecting you right now?

735
00:33:32,440 --> 00:33:33,840
I really am sorry.

736
00:33:33,840 --> 00:33:34,860
I'm just

737
00:33:35,000 --> 00:33:36,690
a little doll who's bad with words.

738
00:33:36,920 --> 00:33:38,500
I'll never run my mouth again.

739
00:33:38,720 --> 00:33:39,720
If you do it again,

740
00:33:40,160 --> 00:33:41,010
you'll spend the rest of your life

741
00:33:41,010 --> 00:33:42,180
as a rag doll.

742
00:33:44,640 --> 00:33:45,180
Fine.

743
00:33:46,000 --> 00:33:46,770
I'll let you off this time.

744
00:33:47,200 --> 00:33:48,140
There's a mass of dark energy.

745
00:33:48,830 --> 00:33:50,090
Yamao and I are going to find it.

746
00:33:50,640 --> 00:33:51,860
Once you find it,

747
00:33:52,160 --> 00:33:53,090
you'll come back for me, right?

748
00:34:01,200 --> 00:34:01,810
Qi Fengyin.

749
00:34:03,350 --> 00:34:03,810
Look.

750
00:34:09,320 --> 00:34:10,690
Doesn't it look like a tiny version of you?

751
00:34:17,550 --> 00:34:18,610
Little Fengxian.

752
00:34:18,670 --> 00:34:19,530
Come to me.

753
00:34:25,190 --> 00:34:25,610
You hit me!

754
00:34:25,880 --> 00:34:26,490
I can't walk anymore.

755
00:34:29,400 --> 00:34:30,090
Can't walk?

756
00:34:31,360 --> 00:34:31,900
Then crawl.

757
00:34:41,150 --> 00:34:42,300
My injuries from Mount Jigu

758
00:34:42,300 --> 00:34:43,380
still haven't fully healed.

759
00:34:44,440 --> 00:34:45,530
It really does hurt.

760
00:34:46,590 --> 00:34:48,260
If I hadn't been trapped in that illusion

761
00:34:49,110 --> 00:34:50,900
and stayed on Mount Jigu for so long,

762
00:34:51,800 --> 00:34:53,050
she wouldn't have suffered these injuries.

763
00:35:04,280 --> 00:35:04,860
Get on.

764
00:35:14,480 --> 00:35:16,090
I knew you were all bark and no bite.

765
00:35:17,440 --> 00:35:18,200
Just this once.

766
00:35:28,520 --> 00:35:29,500
What are you doing now?

767
00:35:33,790 --> 00:35:34,250
Yamao.

768
00:35:36,000 --> 00:35:37,580
A flower in your hair.

769
00:35:37,840 --> 00:35:39,610
Now you're really Fengxian.

770
00:35:44,270 --> 00:35:45,900
Even Youyou knows when to hold back.

771
00:35:46,470 --> 00:35:47,490
But you

772
00:35:47,510 --> 00:35:48,700
keep pushing your luck.

773
00:35:49,920 --> 00:35:50,970
Doesn't that just mean

774
00:35:51,200 --> 00:35:52,490
we're getting closer?

775
00:35:58,640 --> 00:36:00,450
Imagine if someone walked by right now

776
00:36:00,510 --> 00:36:01,450
and couldn't see you.

777
00:36:01,550 --> 00:36:02,570
They'd just see me

778
00:36:02,590 --> 00:36:03,620
floating in midair.

779
00:36:03,790 --> 00:36:05,490
Wouldn't that be a sight?

780
00:36:21,150 --> 00:36:21,810
I can't walk anymore!

781
00:36:25,760 --> 00:36:26,300
You really

782
00:36:26,720 --> 00:36:27,980
need to watch what you say.

783
00:36:29,000 --> 00:36:30,420
Did Yamao

784
00:36:30,440 --> 00:36:31,290
give you another earful?

785
00:36:32,720 --> 00:36:33,100
I...

786
00:36:34,230 --> 00:36:34,620
Forget it.

787
00:36:34,950 --> 00:36:36,100
Just assume Yamao

788
00:36:36,120 --> 00:36:36,930
gave me another earful.

789
00:36:38,000 --> 00:36:38,980
You know how much Yamao

790
00:36:39,120 --> 00:36:40,060
cares about her master.

791
00:36:40,720 --> 00:36:42,220
You shouldn't have

792
00:36:42,220 --> 00:36:42,820
said all those awful things

793
00:36:42,840 --> 00:36:43,980
about High Immortal Danshen to her.

794
00:36:44,200 --> 00:36:45,290
Of course she'd be upset.

795
00:36:46,000 --> 00:36:46,700
I'll say what I want!

796
00:36:47,440 --> 00:36:48,490
No immortal, high or low,

797
00:36:48,750 --> 00:36:49,570
can hold a candle

798
00:36:49,590 --> 00:36:50,290
to His Lordship!

799
00:36:50,640 --> 00:36:51,730
He sacrificed so much

800
00:36:51,730 --> 00:36:52,360
to help Yamao

801
00:36:52,360 --> 00:36:53,290
save her master.

802
00:36:53,720 --> 00:36:54,210
And what does Danshen do?

803
00:36:54,560 --> 00:36:55,820
He sides with the Saintess of the Tides

804
00:36:55,950 --> 00:36:57,540
and the entire immortal sect alliance

805
00:36:57,720 --> 00:36:58,730
to punish His Lordship!

806
00:36:59,030 --> 00:37:00,130
What an ungrateful traitor!

807
00:37:00,310 --> 00:37:01,010
When I see him,

808
00:37:01,310 --> 00:37:03,060
I'll tear him to pieces!

809
00:37:10,750 --> 00:37:11,540
High Immortal Danshen.

810
00:37:16,280 --> 00:37:17,340
Watch your words and actions.

811
00:37:27,950 --> 00:37:28,700
About last night...

812
00:37:28,840 --> 00:37:30,260
Could you have been mistaken?

813
00:37:30,960 --> 00:37:32,130
We've patrolled the whole mountain,

814
00:37:32,470 --> 00:37:33,940
but haven't found anything unusual.

815
00:37:34,030 --> 00:37:35,260
That's because right now,

816
00:37:35,560 --> 00:37:36,730
I can only appear as a spirit.

817
00:37:37,280 --> 00:37:38,780
If I could go to Mount Zhaowu myself,

818
00:37:38,910 --> 00:37:40,260
I'm sure I'd quickly find

819
00:37:40,280 --> 00:37:41,450
that murderous aura.

820
00:37:42,120 --> 00:37:43,940
You're free of the Wanjun Lock now.

821
00:37:44,720 --> 00:37:46,780
You should have no trouble

822
00:37:46,840 --> 00:37:47,730
sneaking into Mount Zhaowu.

823
00:37:48,070 --> 00:37:49,700
Besides, the Saintess is in seclusion.

824
00:37:50,280 --> 00:37:51,220
No one can stop you.

825
00:37:52,350 --> 00:37:53,700
So why won't you show yourself?

826
00:37:55,310 --> 00:37:56,010
I need to rest.

827
00:37:57,150 --> 00:37:58,450
If you notice anything unusual,

828
00:37:58,720 --> 00:37:59,380
call for me.

829
00:38:25,630 --> 00:38:26,820
Earlier on the hill out back,

830
00:38:27,310 --> 00:38:28,890
I tricked Qi Fengyin into carrying me.

831
00:38:29,520 --> 00:38:30,450
Putting that flower in his hair

832
00:38:31,120 --> 00:38:32,660
was just a cover for secretly planting

833
00:38:33,120 --> 00:38:34,570
a talisman mark in his spirit.

834
00:38:34,960 --> 00:38:36,820
I hope this mark

835
00:38:37,070 --> 00:38:38,450
will help me track him down.

836
00:38:39,840 --> 00:38:40,540
Qi Fengyin,

837
00:38:41,310 --> 00:38:42,940
why do you keep refusing to show yourself?

838
00:39:08,560 --> 00:39:09,980
He actually broke through the illusion.

839
00:39:11,150 --> 00:39:12,500
It's only a matter of time

840
00:39:13,520 --> 00:39:15,260
before he escapes the Crystal Prison.

841
00:39:34,520 --> 00:39:36,130
Ever since I put out the flames on Mount Jigu,

842
00:39:36,630 --> 00:39:37,940
I've been unconscious.

843
00:39:38,680 --> 00:39:40,170
So Duyao had me trapped all along.

844
00:39:41,950 --> 00:39:43,540
I wonder if the dark energy on Mount Zhaowu

845
00:39:43,920 --> 00:39:44,980
has anything to do with her.

846
00:39:51,440 --> 00:39:53,050
I need to wait for my Devil's Heart to recover

847
00:39:53,750 --> 00:39:55,050
before I can break out of here.

848
00:39:56,240 --> 00:39:57,930
I can't spare any more power.

849
00:40:18,600 --> 00:40:19,540
It was all fake.

850
00:40:26,590 --> 00:40:27,490
Qi Fengyin?

851
00:40:33,480 --> 00:40:33,980
I...

852
00:40:40,190 --> 00:40:41,340
Your injuries were fake.

853
00:40:43,760 --> 00:40:45,460
You pretended to be weak so I'd carry you.

854
00:40:46,760 --> 00:40:48,420
But you were really trying

855
00:40:48,440 --> 00:40:49,490
to plant this talisman mark on me

856
00:40:50,150 --> 00:40:51,420
so you could track me down.

857
00:40:52,710 --> 00:40:53,780
You're the one who said

858
00:40:55,070 --> 00:40:56,570
